OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for murder of woman
OL,4,Amissing for 28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for life for
OL,7,Fmurdering his partner who went missing
OL,8,F28 years ago - after he suddenly
OL,9,Fconfessed to police that he had
OL,10,Fdisposed of her decomposed body months
OL,11,Fafter killing her.
OL,13,FPatricia Lashley, 33, was last seen
OL,14,Fnear their home on Hall Street, Dudley,
OL,15,Fin September 1998.
OL,17,FTrevor Dunkley, 66, admitted her murder
OL,18,Fat Wolverhampton Crown Court in
OL,19,FSeptember. At the same court on Friday,
OL,20,Ffour of Lashley's children watched as
OL,21,Fhe was handed a life sentence with a
OL,22,Fminimum term of 10 years and 10 months.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
