OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for murder of woman
OL,4,Amissing for 28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Chambers said the defendant had
OL,7,Fhidden Lashley's body in their cellar,
OL,8,Flater disposing of her remains into
OL,9,Fhousehold waste bins. Her remains have
OL,10,Fnever been found.
